    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free exploration: A vast open map, including ruins, dense forests, snow fields and other terrains, players can freely explore, collect resources, and discover hidden plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Combined with the turn-based and skill combo system, players need to choose the best tactics according to the characteristics of the enemy, reasonably match equipment and skills, and improve combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Growth: A unique growth system that allows players to earn experience points through quests, battles, or explorations, freely develop their character's abilities, and unlock new fighting styles and talents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Choices: Every dialogue and choice can affect the direction of the story, and different decisions will shape different story endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Challenges: The game is set up with a wealth of traps and logic puzzles, and players need to use the environment, power-ups, or cooperate with NPCs to solve the difficulties.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free exploration: A vast open map, including ruins, dense forests, snow fields and other terrains, players can freely explore, collect resources, and discover hidden plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Combat: Combined with the turn-based and skill combo system, players need to choose the best tactics according to the characteristics of the enemy, reasonably match equipment and skills, and improve combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Growth: A unique growth system that allows players to earn experience points through quests, battles, or explorations, freely develop their character's abilities, and unlock new fighting styles and talents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Choices: Every dialogue and choice can affect the direction of the story, and different decisions will shape different story endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Challenges: The game is set up with a wealth of traps and logic puzzles, and players need to use the environment, power-ups, or cooperate with NPCs to solve the difficulties.</p>",
    "short_description": "Heart of Y follows the protagonist's journey to find the &quot;Heart of Y&quot; in a shattered world. Players take on the role of an amnesiac traveler as they explore ancient ruins, solve hidden puzzles, and interact with a variety of characters to uncover the truth behind the world.",
